          explanation: 'Gaining much (in usury) he must propitiate the manes, the gods and the Brahmins. Propitiated thus, they quell the evil effects (of usury) undoubtedly. (Thus inbrief) there are ten main ways of suste* nance, vix —learning, arts and crafts, salaried profession, service rendered to rich people, cattle breeding, trading activities, agri* culture, brokerage and liaison activities, begging alms and usury.',
